Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before writing code. New HTTP features start with `pnpm ysk add module <kebab-name> --prisma --web`. Do not invent TypeScript enums, import Prisma from clients, or return JSON outside `{ ok, data }` / `{ ok, error }`. Run `pnpm layers && pnpm typecheck && pnpm test` before finishing.
